{"id":"a197f5a4c2eb61dc","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-pr.md","title":"μ-递归部分函数","display":"df-pr — μ-递归部分函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-pr","aliases":["20-df-pr"],"display":"df-pr — μ-递归部分函数","chapter":"17","section":"17.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 17.2.4","source_pdf_pages":[260],"source_printed_pages":[233],"depends_on":["[[20-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[20-df-composition]]","[[20-df-primitive-recursion]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-pr"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-pr</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pr — μ-递归部分函数"},{"key":"chapter","html":"17"},{"key":"section","html":"17.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 17.2.4"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>260</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>233</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cf6fbe6965e63f34\" href=\"?note=cf6fbe6965e63f34\" title=\"20-df-primitive-recursive\">20-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c6c42d8d708f182d\" href=\"?note=c6c42d8d708f182d\" title=\"20-df-composition\">20-df-composition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0cdf7f1474a3271f\" href=\"?note=0cdf7f1474a3271f\" title=\"20-df-primitive-recursion\">20-df-primitive-recursion</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_k^\\partial=\\{f\\subseteq\\omega^k\\times\\omega:f\\text{ 单值}\\}\">\\(U_k^\\partial=\\{f\\subseteq\\omega^k\\times\\omega:f\\text{ 单值}\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U^\\partial=\\bigcup_kU_k^\\partial\">\\(U^\\partial=\\bigcup_kU_k^\\partial\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\in U_{k+1}^\\partial\">\\(g\\in U_{k+1}^\\partial\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\subseteq U^\\partial\">\\(\\mathcal F\\subseteq U^\\partial\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cf6fbe6965e63f34\" href=\"?note=cf6fbe6965e63f34\" title=\"20-df-primitive-recursive\">20-df-primitive-recursive</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c6c42d8d708f182d\" href=\"?note=c6c42d8d708f182d\" title=\"20-df-composition\">20-df-composition</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0cdf7f1474a3271f\" href=\"?note=0cdf7f1474a3271f\" title=\"20-df-primitive-recursion\">20-df-primitive-recursion</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,m\\in\\omega\">\\(k,m\\in\\omega\\)</span>；未标域的元数量词均在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 上；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_k^\\partial=\\{f\\subseteq\\omega^k\\times\\omega:\\forall\\vec x,y,z\\ [((\\vec x,y)\\in f\\land(\\vec x,z)\\in f)\\Rightarrow y=z]\\}\">\\(U_k^\\partial=\\{f\\subseteq\\omega^k\\times\\omega:\\forall\\vec x,y,z\\ [((\\vec x,y)\\in f\\land(\\vec x,z)\\in f)\\Rightarrow y=z]\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pr}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n(\\mu g)(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\ng(\\vec x,y)\\downarrow=0\\land\\forall z&lt;y\\ \\exists v\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\ [g(\\vec x,z)\\downarrow=v],\\\\\nC_\\partial(\\mathcal F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k,m\\ \\forall h\\in\\mathcal F\\cap U_m^\\partial\\\n\\forall(g_i)_{i&lt;m}\\in(\\mathcal F\\cap U_k^\\partial)^m\\\n[\\operatorname{Comp}(h,(g_i))\\in\\mathcal F],\\\\\nR_\\partial(\\mathcal F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k\\ \\forall g\\in\\mathcal F\\cap U_k^\\partial\\\n\\forall h\\in\\mathcal F\\cap U_{k+2}^\\partial\\ [\\operatorname{Rec}(g,h)\\in\\mathcal F],\\\\\nM(\\mathcal F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k\\ \\forall g\\in\\mathcal F\\cap U_{k+1}^\\partial\\ [\\mu g\\in\\mathcal F],\\\\\n\\mathcal P:=\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal F\\subseteq U^\\partial:\n\\mathcal{PR}\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\land C_\\partial(\\mathcal F)\\land R_\\partial(\\mathcal F)\\land M(\\mathcal F)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PR}_k:=\\mathcal P\\cap U_k^\\partial,\\qquad \\mathrm{PR}:=\\mathrm{PR}_1.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pr}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n(\\mu g)(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\ng(\\vec x,y)\\downarrow=0\\land\\forall z&lt;y\\ \\exists v\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\ [g(\\vec x,z)\\downarrow=v],\\\\\nC_\\partial(\\mathcal F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k,m\\ \\forall h\\in\\mathcal F\\cap U_m^\\partial\\\n\\forall(g_i)_{i&lt;m}\\in(\\mathcal F\\cap U_k^\\partial)^m\\\n[\\operatorname{Comp}(h,(g_i))\\in\\mathcal F],\\\\\nR_\\partial(\\mathcal F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k\\ \\forall g\\in\\mathcal F\\cap U_k^\\partial\\\n\\forall h\\in\\mathcal F\\cap U_{k+2}^\\partial\\ [\\operatorname{Rec}(g,h)\\in\\mathcal F],\\\\\nM(\\mathcal F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k\\ \\forall g\\in\\mathcal F\\cap U_{k+1}^\\partial\\ [\\mu g\\in\\mathcal F],\\\\\n\\mathcal P:=\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal F\\subseteq U^\\partial:\n\\mathcal{PR}\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\land C_\\partial(\\mathcal F)\\land R_\\partial(\\mathcal F)\\land M(\\mathcal F)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PR}_k:=\\mathcal P\\cap U_k^\\partial,\\qquad \\mathrm{PR}:=\\mathrm{PR}_1.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>所有未限定的元数量词在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 上。最小化要求更小的测试值全部已定义且非零，输出由最小性唯一；严格复合及原始递归沿上游签名使用。本书以命中 1 定义搜索，这里经基础函数值变换改为命中 0，产生相同函数族。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 17.2.4；印刷页 233；PDF 第 260 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"cf6fbe6965e63f34","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-composition","status":"resolved","id":"c6c42d8d708f182d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-composition]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-primitive-recursion","status":"resolved","id":"0cdf7f1474a3271f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-primitive-recursion]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"cf6fbe6965e63f34","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-primitive-recursive]]；see [[20-df-composition]]；see [[20-df-primitive-recursion]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-composition","status":"resolved","id":"c6c42d8d708f182d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-primitive-recursive]]；see [[20-df-composition]]；see [[20-df-primitive-recursion]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-primitive-recursion","status":"resolved","id":"0cdf7f1474a3271f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-primitive-recursive]]；see [[20-df-composition]]；see [[20-df-primitive-recursion]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U_k^\\partial=\\{f\\subseteq\\omega^k\\times\\omega:f\\text{ 单值}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"U^\\partial=\\bigcup_kU_k^\\partial","display":false},{"tex":"g\\in U_{k+1}^\\partial","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F\\subseteq U^\\partial","display":false},{"tex":"k,m\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"U_k^\\partial=\\{f\\subseteq\\omega^k\\times\\omega:\\forall\\vec x,y,z\\ [((\\vec x,y)\\in f\\land(\\vec x,z)\\in f)\\Rightarrow y=z]\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pr}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n(\\mu g)(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\ng(\\vec x,y)\\downarrow=0\\land\\forall z<y\\ \\exists v\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\ [g(\\vec x,z)\\downarrow=v],\\\\\nC_\\partial(\\mathcal F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k,m\\ \\forall h\\in\\mathcal F\\cap U_m^\\partial\\\n\\forall(g_i)_{i<m}\\in(\\mathcal F\\cap U_k^\\partial)^m\\\n[\\operatorname{Comp}(h,(g_i))\\in\\mathcal F],\\\\\nR_\\partial(\\mathcal F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k\\ \\forall g\\in\\mathcal F\\cap U_k^\\partial\\\n\\forall h\\in\\mathcal F\\cap U_{k+2}^\\partial\\ [\\operatorname{Rec}(g,h)\\in\\mathcal F],\\\\\nM(\\mathcal F)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall k\\ \\forall g\\in\\mathcal F\\cap U_{k+1}^\\partial\\ [\\mu g\\in\\mathcal F],\\\\\n\\mathcal P:=\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal F\\subseteq U^\\partial:\n\\mathcal{PR}\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\land C_\\partial(\\mathcal F)\\land R_\\partial(\\mathcal F)\\land M(\\mathcal F)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PR}_k:=\\mathcal P\\cap U_k^\\partial,\\qquad \\mathrm{PR}:=\\mathrm{PR}_1.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":2377,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bad781655752e9f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pr]]。"},{"id":"0399f7532457c99d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-pr]]。"},{"id":"f72d107b70d58355","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-primitive-recursive]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-pr]]。"},{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-38","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-pr]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-pr]] — 章 17；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-pr]]"}],"outgoing":["cf6fbe6965e63f34","c6c42d8d708f182d","0cdf7f1474a3271f"]}